"""Hand-reviewed mapping of every MASTER_MODEL program line item (after clean_prog + nkey) to the catalog.
Spec grammar:
  '=<library raw name>'            -> existing library/reference record (resolved with nkey)
  '+<new_key>'                      -> program-only record defined in NEW
  '&<type>:<spec>|<spec>|...'       -> complex record (type = superset, complex, circuit, choice, sequence); components use = or +
  '!<reason>'                       -> not an exercise (block label, quality label, note)
Optional cue after '#': e.g. '=Reverse Lunges #DB' (stored on the alias as a modifier/cue).
All mappings are INFERRED from the verbatim program text unless stated."""

